			"Malaysia's 2020 census counted 9.1% of the population as Christian, alongside 63.5% Muslim, 18.7% Buddhist and 6.1% Hindu. Christians are about half of Sarawak (50.1%) and a large minority in Sabah (24.7%). You can read and hear the Scriptures they treasure free in Father's Heart Bible™ at fathersheartbible.com/read.",
	},
